# Colorstorm Stallion's opus: "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. If five or more
# mana was spent to cast that spell, create a token that's a copy of this creature." Turn 3: Bot1 casts Mind Twist for X = 4, five mana
# ({4}{B}: Swamp, Mountain and the three Moxen). The Stallion is a 4/4 until end of turn, and a token copy enters as a 3/3: the token
# copies the copiable values and not the +1/+1 (CR 707.2), has haste (a copiable keyword) and the opus. Mind Twist makes Bot2 discard 4
# of its 7 cards. On turn 5 Lightning Bolt (one mana) is cast: both Stallions trigger, each 4/4 until end of turn and no third
# Stallion, since only one mana was spent.

